ement":"The US business sales declined by 9.7% during the quarter.","quote":"Overall, the U.S. business reported sales of USD427 million for the quarter, declining by 9.7%.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUNPHARMA456_06082026165829_IntimationSE20260806EarningsCallTranscriptQ1FY27_Signed.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Formulation revenues in the Rest of the World were slightly lower compared to the first quarter of the previous year.","quote":"Formulation revenues in Rest of the World for the quarter were USD218 million, marginally lower than quarter 1 last year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUNPHARMA456_06082026165829_IntimationSE20260806EarningsCallTranscriptQ1FY27_Signed.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"The company expects the effective tax rate to remain in a similar range as the first quarter until the Organon transaction closes.","quote":"Going forward, and until Organon closing, we expect the tax rate to be in a similar range as in Q1.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUNPHARMA456_06082026165829_IntimationSE20260806EarningsCallTranscriptQ1FY27_Signed.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The company is maintaining its guidance of high single-digit growth for the full year.","quote":"Think we should stick on to the high single-digit growth for the full year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUNPHARMA456_06082026165829_IntimationSE20260806EarningsCallTranscriptQ1FY27_Signed.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"The company expects to meet the market demand and is prepared for the product launch.","quote":"And I'm hopeful that we will meet the market demand. So we are well prepared for this launch.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUNPHARMA456_06082026165829_IntimationSE20260806EarningsCallTranscriptQ1FY27_Signed.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"There is some pricing pressure in emerging markets, but it is not the main driver of performance.","quote":"And while there is a bit some element of pricing pressure, but I would not say that would be the driving force.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUNPHARMA456_06082026165829_IntimationSE20260806EarningsCallTranscriptQ1FY27_Signed.pdf","page":19.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Multiple factors, including annual increments and field force expansion, are impacting the company's employee costs.","quote":"So let me put it in a slightly different way. There are two or three elements that actually impact the people cost or the salaries and comp and ben, right?","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUNPHARMA456_06082026165829_IntimationSE20260806EarningsCallTranscriptQ1FY27_Signed.pdf","page":18.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"EBITDA margins were slightly lower at 28.9% due to the previous year's benefit from Lenalidomide sales.","quote":"EBITDA margins came in at 28.9% while EBITDA margins were slightly lower, please note that Q1 FY26 had some benefit from Lenalidomide sales.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUNPHARMA456_06082026165829_IntimationSE20260806EarningsCallTranscriptQ1FY27_Signed.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"The company maintains a strong balance sheet with a net cash position of 3.4 billion dollars.","quote":"Balance sheet of Sun continues to be strong with a net cash of $3.4 billion at the consolidated level.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUNPHARMA456_06082026165829_IntimationSE20260806EarningsCallTranscriptQ1FY27_Signed.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The company has obtained approvals to manufacture and market generic semaglutide injection in Brazil and South Africa.","quote":"Recently, we have received approvals to manufacture and market the generic version of semaglutide injection in both Brazil and South Africa for the treatment of adults with Type 2 diabetes.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUNPHARMA456_06082026165829_IntimationSE20260806EarningsCallTranscriptQ1FY27_Signed.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"The company holds the top position with an 8.5% market share in the Indian pharmaceutical market.","quote":"Sun Pharma is ranked number 1 and holds 8.5% market share in the over INR2,527 billion Indian pharmaceutical market as per Pharmarack MAT June 2026.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUNPHARMA456_06082026165829_IntimationSE20260806EarningsCallTranscriptQ1FY27_Signed.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"Geopolitical issues and difficult macroeconomic conditions in certain countries are impacting emerging markets.","quote":"So, I think emerging markets, I would characterize the impact as a combination of both the geopolitical issues and difficult macroeconomic conditions in certain countries.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUNPHARMA456_06082026165829_IntimationSE20260806EarningsCallTranscriptQ1FY27_Signed.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"positive","quote":"So we are expecting healthy growth to continue for innovative business in U.S., driven by new launches, as you know, Unloxcyt and Ilumya is also doing well.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUNPHARMA456_06082026165829_IntimationSE20260806EarningsCallTranscriptQ1FY27_Signed.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"}],"kpis":[{"kpi":"US sales (US$ mn)","va